notes.body:
this temporary variable is useless. Moreover removing the next_tvb creation is wrong. Why don't you simply do:
```
next_tvb = tvb_new_subset_remaining(tvb, offset);
if (!dissector_try_uint_new(papi_dissector_table, PORT_UBT, next_tvb, pinfo, tree, TRUE, NULL)) {
    call_data_dissector(next_tvb, pinfo, tree);
}
```

